NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000039 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000040 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000041 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000042 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000043 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000044 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000045 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000046 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000047 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000048 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000049 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000050 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000051 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000052 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000053 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000054 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000055 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000056 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000057 ""
